   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Frequently Asked Questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4063",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "What documents are required for a complete application?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Please send us your application materials digitally, preferably using the application form provided with the job posting.</p> <p>A complete application package must include at least the following documents:</p><ul><li>Cover letter</li><li>Complete resume</li><li>Certificates and transcripts</li></ul>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4060",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How do I know if my application was received successfully?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Please use the application form provided with the job posting. Once your application has been successfully submitted, you will receive a confirmation email at the email address you provided.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4056",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How long will my application materials be stored?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Your data will remain stored in our system for a maximum of 2 months after the application process is complete and will be deleted thereafter.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4054",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What is the application process like at ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>You will receive an automatic acknowledgment of receipt via email once your application has been received by our system. Based on past experience, editing typically takes between two and three weeks. We will let you know whether we would like to invite you for an interview or whether we will fill the location with another candidate.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4052",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can I submit a speculative application to ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Of course, you are also welcome to submit a speculative application.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4068",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can I apply to write my thesis at ZOLLER?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>We would be delighted if you’d like to write a practice-oriented bachelor’s or master’s thesis at our company. You can simply send us your proposed topics for specific business areas <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:bewerbung@zoller.info\" title=\"An die Personalabteilung\">by email</a>. Ideally, you should establish a connection between your thesis and an internship at ZOLLER.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4072",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Does ZOLLER also offer a dual degree program?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, ZOLLER offers the following degree programs for a dual study program at the DHBW in Stuttgart:</p><ul><li>Data Science and Artificial Intelligence</li><li>Computer Science</li><li>Computer Science – Information Technology</li><li>Mechanical Engineering – Design and Development</li><li>Industrial Engineering – General Industrial Engineering</li></ul><p>The dual study program begins in the winter semester of each year. For more information<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://www.dhbw-stuttgart.de/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">,</a> visit the ZOLLER website in the “Dual Study Program” area or the <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://www.dhbw-stuttgart.de/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DHWB</a> website <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://www.dhbw-stuttgart.de/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">in Stuttgart</a>.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c4074",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c4062",
